@* Exercise 052 - JS Interop Module (intermediate).
   Goal:   Import a JS module exactly once, on first render, and dispose it when done.
   Drills: IJSRuntime.InvokeAsync<IJSObjectReference>("import", ...), guarding a
           lifecycle method that reruns on every render pass so it imports only once.
   Passes: dotnet test --filter FullyQualifiedName~Ex052_ *@
<span id="ready">@(_module is null ? "no" : "yes")</span>

@code {
